CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Off the Roll: the revision across India
X-WR-CALDESC:Each state's draft and final roll\, the Supreme Court's dated 
 orders\, court hearings and deadlines ahead\, and events still to come on 
 the Special Intensive Revision.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Kolkata
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sc-2025-07-10@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250710
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250711
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: The Supreme Court hears the challenge
DESCRIPTION:The Court issued notice on the petitions against the 24 June or
 der. It observed that the Commission should also consider Aadhaar\, the vo
 ter identity card and the ration card\, but gave no direction to accept th
 em. This account of the hearing comes from the Court's judgment of 27 May 
 2026. Source: https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/35785/35785_2025_1_
 1501_71617_Judgement_27-May-2026.pdf More: https://offtheroll.in/india/pro
 cess/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bihar-draft@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250802
SUMMARY:Bihar: draft roll published
DESCRIPTION:Draft roll published. More: https://offtheroll.in/bihar/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/bihar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sc-2025-08-14@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250815
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: The names left off must be published
DESCRIPTION:The Court recorded the Commission's agreement to publish the ro
 ughly 65 lakh names left off the draft with the reason for each. The lists
  were to go up district by district\, searchable by EPIC number (the numbe
 r on the voter identity card)\, online and on panchayat and block notice b
 oards. The public notice was to say that a claim could be made with a copy
  of Aadhaar. Source: https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/35785/35785_
 2025_2_34_63142_Order_14-Aug-2025.pdf More: https://offtheroll.in/india/pr
 ocess/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sc-2025-08-22@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250822
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250823
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: Political parties brought in
DESCRIPTION:Twelve political parties were made parties to the case. They we
 re told to have their booth agents help voters file forms with any of the 
 11 documents or with Aadhaar. This account of the order comes from the 202
 6 judgment. Source: https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/35785/35785_2
 025_1_1501_71617_Judgement_27-May-2026.pdf More: https://offtheroll.in/ind
 ia/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sc-2025-09-01@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250902
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: Claims after the deadline
DESCRIPTION:The Commission told the Court that claims\, objections and corr
 ections could still be made after 1 September and would be considered up t
 o the last date of nominations. The Court directed the chairman of the Bih
 ar State Legal Services Authority to have the district legal services auth
 orities send para-legal volunteers to help voters and parties file them on
 line. This account of the order also comes from the 2026 judgment. Source:
  https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/35785/35785_2025_1_1501_71617_Ju
 dgement_27-May-2026.pdf More: https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sc-2025-09-08@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250909
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: Aadhaar becomes the 12th document
DESCRIPTION:The Court directed that Aadhaar be accepted as the 12th documen
 t\, as proof of identity. The Court said it is no proof of citizenship\, a
 nd the authorities remained free to verify each card. Source: https://api.
 sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/35785/35785_2025_2_26_63969_Order_08-Sep-2025
 .pdf More: https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
