DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260225
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: Judges from Jharkhand and Odisha\, and no appeal to 
 officials
DESCRIPTION:A further order set out the work given to the judicial officers
  and said their orders could not be appealed before any executive or admin
 istrative officer. Judicial officers from Odisha and Jharkhand joined thos
 e of West Bengal\, and by 10 March there were 200 of them beside more than
  500 from West Bengal. This account of the order comes from the Court's or
 der of 10 March 2026. Source: https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/642
 35/64235_2025_1_42_69352_Order_10-Mar-2026.pdf More: https://offtheroll.in
 /india/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
