 heard with the matters on Uttar Pradesh and Chhattisgarh
DESCRIPTION:Petitions on Kerala's revision\, heard with the matters on Utta
 r Pradesh and Chhattisgarh. On 30 October the Election Commission was give
 n four weeks to file its counter affidavit and to answer the points in the
  petitioners' note. The date is approximate\, worked out from 30 October 2
 026 and four weeks. Court: Supreme Court. Source: Times Now Navbharat\, ht
 tps://timesnowhindi.com/india/supreme-court-refuses-to-extend-deadline-for
 -sir-in-kerala-article-156434228 More: https://offtheroll.in/india/dispute
 s/#d-court-56
